# Cursor AI Rules - organize_music

- Python >= 3.12, strict type hints on all functions and return types.
- Follow PEP 8 via `ruff`. Line length: 100.
- Markdown files must follow `UPPERCASE_WITH_UNDERSCORES.md` naming.
- All shell scripts belong in `scripts/`.
- Git commits must strictly use Conventional Commits format (`feat:`, `fix:`, etc.).
- Never perform destructive file moves or deletes without a `--dry-run` flag.
- Keep all files under 200 lines. Break large files into modular, cohesive components.
- Verification command before proposing completion: `ruff check . && ruff format --check . && pytest`
